        // from an array slot can be re-stamped with its real element tag (unblocks
        // B4/B5 element returns). 2 args. arm64 + x86_64 STMT_CALL special-case.
        "__hx_make_val",
        // RT-NATIVE M5-syscall (2026-06-18): `__hx_target_os()` — 0-arg compile-time
